---
title: "How should a field and its choices group?"
accTitle: "Field block grouping"
accDescr: "Today field rows and choice clouds are siblings with tiny margins. Proposed field blocks wrap each row with its chips, add a hairline and gap before the next field, and paint a 1-9 keycap on the row."
config:
  layout: dagre
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 10
    nodeSpacing: 22
    wrappingWidth: 180
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph TODAY["Today"]
    direction TB
    TS["`**Status row**`"]
    TC["`**Choice cloud**`"]
    TCLAIM["`**Claim row**`"]
    TSEC["`**Section row**`"]
    TS --> TC
    TC --> TCLAIM
    TCLAIM --> TSEC
  end
  subgraph PROPOSED["Proposed"]
    direction TB
    B1["`**Block 1**<br/>keycap + Status + chips`"]
    B2["`**Block 2**<br/>keycap + Claim`"]
    B3["`**Block 3**<br/>keycap + Section + chips`"]
    B1 -.->|"hairline and gap"| B2
    B2 -.->|"hairline and gap"| B3
  end
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef proposed stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class TS,TC,TCLAIM,TSEC muted
  class B1,B2,B3 outcome
  class B1,B2,B3 proposed
  style TODAY fill:none,stroke:#6B7280
  style PROPOSED fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
